# Party banter: Madoc's fire has requests.
dialogue TSC_Banter_FireLikesTheLongOne

== start ==
Madoc: Sing the long one. The fire sits up for the long one.

Wren: Your fire has better taste than half the rooms I've played.

Madoc: Oh, it has no taste at all! It only likes company.

Wren stops mid-chord.

Wren: ...I'm putting that in something.

* [Leave them to it.] -> end
